<title>ZAMBIA: ZAMBIAN APRIL M3 MONEY SUPPLY UP 4.7 PCT M/M.</title>
<headline>ZAMBIAN APRIL M3 MONEY SUPPLY UP 4.7 PCT M/M.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia's year-on-year broadly defined M3 money supply grew 4.7 percent in April after a 2.1 percent increase in March, the central bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>On a year-on-year basis, money supply rose 34.9 percent.</p>
<p>M3 (mln Zambian kwacha):</p>
<p>    Apr 97	 Mar 97	 Apr 96</p>
<p>    618,311.2    590,737.8    458,419.2</p>
<p>-- Lusaka newsroom +26 1-222689</p>
